    your Main Phase this turn, in addition to your Normal Summon/Set. (You can only
    gain this effect once per turn.) If this card is sent to the GY as Synchro Material:
    You can inflict 100 damage to your opponent for each of your banished "Battlewasp"
    monsters. You can only use this effect of "Battlewasp - Sachi the Ceremonial
    Bow" once per turn.'
